2. DOES THE OPTIMISER CLAMP EVER BIND?
==============================================================================
gbm_uniform clamp (train_max=5.972): bound on 0/365 decisions (0.00%); 0 candidate prices excluded

Interpretation: with training data spanning the whole band, train_max == price_max,
so no reachable price can exceed it — the clamp is inert. The coverage change,
not the clamp, is doing the work (see the ablation in section 4).

